Star Wars: The Mandalorian and Grogu | Official Podcast | Episode 1: Growing Up
To coincide with Star Wars: The Mandalorian and Grogu’s release on Disney+, we are taking fans behind the scenes with the team that made the movie. In this first episode of the podcast, writer-director Jon Favreau sits down with co-writer and President of Lucasfilm, Dave Filoni for the first installment of their two part conversation. Jon Favreau then hosts a roundtable discussion with the stars of the film, including Pedro Pascal, who plays the Mandalorian, Sigourney Weaver, who plays Colonel Ward, and even Grogu himself crashes the party.

